# FOREVER-TITLE-LEGENDARY-001: only the Draft payload and the two-source
# manifest are committed. Downloaded developer documents stay owner-local.
!forever-data/projects/the-title-legendary/
forever-data/projects/the-title-legendary/*
!forever-data/projects/the-title-legendary/source-manifest.json
!forever-data/projects/the-title-legendary/progressive/
forever-data/projects/the-title-legendary/progressive/*
!forever-data/projects/the-title-legendary/progressive/payload.json

# Catalogue 10 draft packages. EXACTLY six payload files are allowed through,
# across five projects — Rainpalm contributes two of them, its active payload and
# the archived fast-intake version. Every directory around them stays ignored. In
# particular `intake/`, `sip/` and any `source/` directory are re-ignored below,
# so a newly added local evidence file, PDF, image or media asset under those
# paths can never become trackable by accident. Files already tracked from an
# earlier commit stay tracked — .gitignore does not untrack — but nothing new
# joins them without a deliberate, separately reviewed rule.
#
# The count above is the human-readable specification of a safety guard, so it
# must be updated whenever a `!` exception is added or removed below. A stale
# count invites a later reader to "fix" the rules to match it.
!forever-data/projects/rainpalm-villas/
forever-data/projects/rainpalm-villas/*
!forever-data/projects/rainpalm-villas/progressive/
forever-data/projects/rainpalm-villas/progressive/*
!forever-data/projects/rainpalm-villas/progressive/payload.json
!forever-data/projects/rainpalm-villas/progressive/payload.fast-intake-v1.json
!forever-data/projects/garden-of-eden/
forever-data/projects/garden-of-eden/*
!forever-data/projects/garden-of-eden/progressive/
forever-data/projects/garden-of-eden/progressive/*
!forever-data/projects/garden-of-eden/progressive/payload.json
!forever-data/projects/the-title-sierra/
forever-data/projects/the-title-sierra/*
!forever-data/projects/the-title-sierra/progressive/
forever-data/projects/the-title-sierra/progressive/*
!forever-data/projects/the-title-sierra/progressive/payload.json
